summary: Feature flags and A/B tests for ogygia. A kill switch, a rollout, a targeting rule and an A/B/n test are one primitive, flag(), decided on the server during SSR, so the chosen variant is what renders, with no client SDK and no JS for the decision.
related:
  - flags/guide
